      "title": "University Assistant (postdoc)",
      "description": "University Assistant (postdoc) Back PDF output Apply online University Assistant (postdoc) Start date/duration: as soon as possible for 2 years Administrative unit: Department of Ecology Extent of employment: 40 hours per week Job Description: Your responsibilities: ·      Independent research in the field of landscape ecology, with a focus on spatial processes, ecological legacies or human–environment interactions, including the publication of high-quality scientific papers in international peer-reviewed journals - Contribution to interdisciplinary research activities, teaching and administrative work, in particular the acquisition and implementation of national and international research projects, the conduct of geographical and environmental data analyses, and involvement in teaching in the field of landscape ecology -      Contribution to teaching and the supervision of students in the field of Landscape Ecology Doctoral degree (PhD) in Ecology, Geography, Landscape Ecology, Remote Sensing, Environmental history or a related discipline Strong international publication record and demonstrated experience in scientific publishing Research interest in long-term human–environment interactions, historical ecology and/or remote sensing Technical affinity and willingness to engage with and quantitative research approaches Excellent command of English, both spoken and written Basic knowledge of German or willingness to further develop German language skills Ability to work in a team, independence and high communicative competence Euraxess: https://euraxess.ec.europa.eu/platforms/jobs/139/BIO-15960 The description associated with this job duties and requirements can be found at: https://www.uibk.ac.at/en/personalabteilung/wissenschaftliches_personal/profile/#post-doc Our offer: With us, you can expect exciting tasks, flexible working hours, a family-friendly working environment, attractive training and development opportunities, a paid lunch break, a